{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7001_p", "source_sha256": "6a3ec8bd92b8184333abddfcac3213dd728e9c649df6f273a9fb6a65e6f43335", "ja": "（今日は『ドラゴンが人間の世界にやってきたら』と\nいうテーマでグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ）", "zh": "（今天要以“如果龙来到了人类世界”为主题，为写真杂志『偶像写真！！』拍摄照片。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7002_012mam", "source_sha256": "207ba68c5db1f9265b065294f889dda3647d9a1d2fc7512521c7c01427607e72", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　こんなにかわいいドラゴンが本当に\n街の中に現れたら、みんなパニック間違いなしっしょ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿～♪　这么可爱的龙真的出现在街上的话，大家肯定会陷入恐慌吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7003_p", "source_sha256": "39ed9597c8fb8af59b267e698d21aac6ce0cbeec2d82ff6b7ae15be118bbc81c", "ja": "ははは。テレビに、野次馬に……今ごろ人だかりで\nすごいことになっていたかもしれないな。", "zh": "哈哈哈。要是真的出现在电视上，再加上围观的人……现在说不定已经被人群围得水泄不通，场面相当壮观了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7004_012mam", "source_sha256": "2570e0602b73bd146163be1380bb9247c26bcc713f54f563a673a780bdb80449", "ja": "ねー？　でも、みんな忙しいのか全然人がいない……。\nうあうあ～！　もっとみんなに注目されたいよ～！", "zh": "对吧？不过，大家是不是都很忙啊，完全没人……。\n呜哇呜哇～！我想得到大家更多的关注啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7005_012mam", "source_sha256": "c7e62cd6a46bdbc504124d612febdaeaf55c17ff8872e581c8c6d04621c2827b", "ja": "真美は上を目指すオンナ……じゃなくて、ドラゴン\nだかんね！　兄ちゃんも一緒に注目をかっさらおう！", "zh": "真美可是立志要飞黄腾达的女人……不对，是龙！  \n所以哥哥也和真美一起，把大家的目光都抢过来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7006_p", "source_sha256": "6b14c8ceb9bec07e2b9d8d7a10452fb2de1a72bea6754d9903c0818906af1eea", "ja": "え、俺もか？　うーん、真美の気持ちは嬉しいが、\n俺は普通の格好だから難しいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "诶，我也要吗？嗯，真美的心意我很开心，不过我穿得很普通，可能很难吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7007_012mam", "source_sha256": "fdf5592d222c0d2be02af7118ff5a2312a7a99af567b227838f9f0976cdb2bd8", "ja": "あっ、そっか。じゃあ兄ちゃんの分まで真美が\n目立たなくっちゃね！　うーん、何が必要かな～？", "zh": "啊，这样啊。那连哥哥的份一起，真美也得好好引人注目才行！嗯——需要些什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7008", "source_sha256": "1cb30ce75a26c215b0b20a0aed86cc7d6a1aaac139f339638bfdfda3390e06b8", "ja": "カリスマ性だ！", "zh": "这是魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7009", "source_sha256": "09fa741dc11834cf7d1fa0b14a8608bdc9d86e048684bd55bba7b5ed0c10388d", "ja": "飛べ！", "zh": "飞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7200_p", "source_sha256": "a55d074d2f8ba673657b1a9715fc569d41860c38b2639d43f00c12ae73e42ad2", "ja": "ドラゴンのカッコよさと真美の可愛さを合わせて、\nカリスマ感を全面的に押し出してみる……とかどうだ？", "zh": "把巨龙的帅气和真美的可爱结合起来，\n试着全面展现出领袖气场……你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7201_012mam", "source_sha256": "d41ac2f5a80cdf83459c56d29523d34f117070e25cb71b8fe87a15ab29db3f1b", "ja": "おお！？　んっふっふ～！　兄ちゃんもドラゴンと\n真美のスペシャルな魅力、わかってるじゃ～ん？", "zh": "哦哦！？　哼呼呼～！兄长也懂得龙和真美的特别魅力嘛～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7202_012mam", "source_sha256": "f7eeff42ec4d4c52464cfa2e3df7e2b0d7f9eaced5cbb5bba6c01c7048c39b04", "ja": "そんな兄ちゃんには、真美のカリスマを存分に浴びせて\nあげる！　カ～リ～ス～マ～波ーっ☆　……どうどう？", "zh": "既然是这样的哥哥，就让你尽情沐浴在真美的超凡魅力中吧！  \n超～凡～魅～力～波——☆……怎么样怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7300_p", "source_sha256": "a55d074d2f8ba673657b1a9715fc569d41860c38b2639d43f00c12ae73e42ad2", "ja": "ドラゴンのカッコよさと真美の可愛さを合わせて、\nカリスマ感を全面的に押し出してみる……とかどうだ？", "zh": "把巨龙的帅气和真美的可爱结合起来，\n试着全面展现出领袖气场……你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7301_012mam", "source_sha256": "73628293bb5cfe1a180ed0d4520a508a02f32d8b2d1c8e3eabc6924e6993c97a", "ja": "「真美のせくしーにメロメロになあれ♪」とか、\n「褒美に世界の半分をくれてやろう！」とか？", "zh": "比如“快被真美的性感迷得神魂颠倒吧♪”\n或是“作为奖赏，本王就把这世界分你一半！”这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7302_012mam", "source_sha256": "853f97cba27c01ee3f13d95ad52c4ba14e2b6edf7f5152038fe4211f4fe4ae0b", "ja": "あ、待って！　半分はちょっと多いかな。3分の1、\nいや亜美と兄ちゃんの分……うぅ、カリスマ難しい～！", "zh": "啊，等等！一半是不是有点多了。按3份来分，拿1份，不对，是亚美和哥哥的份……呜呜，魅力好难啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7500_p", "source_sha256": "7ce99b995f664279bb9f850a2303d210ee1fd3a1c2e7d5287d0e4b25147d7fe2", "ja": "空に飛び立ったら、きっと驚くぞ！", "zh": "飞上天空的话，大家一定会大吃一惊的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7501_012mam", "source_sha256": "6cc19df3eb602bdb225617dcd68f70aa95258754d4ef985f28ccd4283fec17ec", "ja": "おお～、なんかザ・ドラゴンって感じがしていいね！\nみんなが振り向くこと間違いなしっしょ！", "zh": "哦哦～，感觉就是“巨龙”嘛，真不错！\n绝对会让大家都回头看的，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7502_012mam", "source_sha256": "2cd99bf19e19e351d04590cea91ea22406bfc00ab3a72f87466f223afb2c5b3d", "ja": "撮影でもやりたいから、空を飛べる方法考えて！\n言い出しっぺの兄ちゃん、よろよろ～♪", "zh": "我也想在拍摄时试试，所以快想个能飞上天的办法！\n这个提议可是哥哥你先说的，就拜托啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7600_p", "source_sha256": "7ce99b995f664279bb9f850a2303d210ee1fd3a1c2e7d5287d0e4b25147d7fe2", "ja": "空に飛び立ったら、きっと驚くぞ！", "zh": "飞上天空的话，大家一定会大吃一惊的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7601_012mam", "source_sha256": "57e4bc598a1c3ae6456a220629f36bb367b52bda2ee1b6c271a85246a6c47209", "ja": "なるほどね！　でもジャンプするだけだと、飛んだ\n感じあんまりしないよね～。……あ、そうだ！", "zh": "原来如此！不过光是跳跃的话，感觉不太像飞起来了，对吧～。……啊，有了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_7602_012mam", "source_sha256": "1b5025f4356c837d64f28c9526fae5f321346815d96719e3ebd217c4e0cb71fd", "ja": "はい！　……。ん？　何ボーっとしてんの、兄ちゃん！\nしゃがんでしゃがんで！　肩車させたげる♪", "zh": "是！……嗯？哥哥你在发什么呆呢！\n快蹲下快蹲下！我来让你骑在肩膀上♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
